{{!
    @template local_oksigeniamarandu/channel_day

    A day of the week on the page of the channel, as a sheet that is touched: on or off, saved at a touch. The day on
    goes as a hidden field at the top of its form, so that this button, sent last, changes it.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * group, value - The setting (review, post or class) and the number of the day.
    * label, name, on - Its letter, its name and whether it is on.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "group": "review", "value": 1, "label": "M", "name": "Monday", "on": true
    }
}}
<button type="submit" class="mrd-hoja" name="{{group}}days[{{value}}]" value="{{#on}}0{{/on}}{{^on}}1{{/on}}" aria-pressed="{{#on}}true{{/on}}{{^on}}false{{/on}}" title="{{name}}"><span aria-hidden="true">{{label}}</span><span class="sr-only visually-hidden">{{name}}</span></button>
